==Battleground==
*5 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] to rush down the first Mooth and use the cash gained to summon other attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]]. 3 or more meatshields are necessary to stall the constant Aku Gories.

